--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ddc349f0a26451848b441f5abb364850, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 22915969024
    m_Localized: 'Listen up, defender! Your job is simple: keep my kingdom in one
      piece. Try not to mess it up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22966300672
    m_Localized: Pay attention! First, you craft defense cards - make lots, you'll
      need them. Then you actually USE them to stop enemies from waltzing into MY
      kingdom. Got it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22970494976
    m_Localized: Progress bar complete means showtime! Time to prove you're worth
      keeping around as my defender.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22970494977
    m_Localized: That number shows how many waves you need to survive before I declare
      you competent. No pressure!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22970494978
    m_Localized: Buy boosters from shops - because apparently you need all the help
      you can get!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22970494979
    m_Localized: Click those boosters to open them. Revolutionary concept, I know
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9360233590784
    m_Localized: All your crafting ideas, neatly organized. You're welcome for my
      excellent organization skills!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9360267145216
    m_Localized: Feel free to pause and think - I know strategy isn't your strong
      suit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9360267145217
    m_Localized: Time acceleration available for the impatient. Use it if you actually
      know what you're doing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9360267145218
    m_Localized: Shortcuts are here because I'm generous enough to make your life
      easier. Have an eye on them after.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160626044928
    m_Localized: Card limit reached! Shocking, I know. Maybe try building a barn
      instead of panicking?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160672182272
    m_Localized: Maximum defenses reached! Try constructing a house instead of staring
      at me helplessly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160680570880
    m_Localized: 'Seriously! You claim to defend my kingdom, and you haven''t crafted
      any defense cards yet?!

      What are you waiting for?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160684765184
    m_Localized: How would you do without me ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160688959488
    m_Localized: 'Watch out! Our kingdom is threatened! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160688959489
    m_Localized: Still standing! Well... mostly standing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160697348096
    m_Localized: We were just testing their damage output. For science!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160701542400
    m_Localized: Perfect execution! ...of getting hit by everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160705736704
    m_Localized: Well, that's coming out of your paycheck... if I actually paid you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160709931008
    m_Localized: Don't worry, I'm sure the enemies will be gentler next time. They
      seem reasonable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160718319616
    m_Localized: Outstanding! At this rate, I'll need to find a new kingdom by Tuesday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160722513920
    m_Localized: Excellent work! I was getting bored of my walls being intact anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160730902528
    m_Localized: And that, folks, is how it's done. Take notes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160730902529
    m_Localized: 'Not a scratch on my beautiful kingdom. I suppose you''ll want a
      raise now?

      What do you mean you are not paid?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160735096832
    m_Localized: Perfect! Now do that every time and we'll get along just fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160743485440
    m_Localized: 'Naturally flawless defense! That''s what I pay you for... right?

      What
      do you mean you are not paid?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160747679744
    m_Localized: Zero damage? I should probably thank you... but I won't. It's your
      job!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160751874048
    m_Localized: Temple complete! Now we're talking - time for the big guns!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160756068352
    m_Localized: There we go! Your first step toward not completely embarrassing
      yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160764456960
    m_Localized: First craft complete! Look who figured out how to make something
      useful!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160768651264
    m_Localized: A factory! Finally, someone who understands efficiency. Now we're
      getting somewhere!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160772845568
    m_Localized: 'Pro tip from your generous ruler: Hold Shift while moving cards
      to magnet similar ones together. You''re welcome!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160777039872
    m_Localized: Short on ink for boosters? Just sell some cards! It's called 'strategic
      downsizing' - look it up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2672160777039873
    m_Localized: Drop ink on the shop for boosters! It's not rocket science, just
      basic shopping
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11237037883912192
    m_Localized: "      Move Camera\n     <sprite name=w>\n<sprite name=a><sprite
      name=s><sprite name=d> or <sprite name=mr>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11237342583320576
    m_Localized: 'Zoom

      <sprite name=mm>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11237449185751040
    m_Localized: 'Pause

      <sprite name=space>

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11237566206832640
    m_Localized: 'Speed up/down

      <sprite name=e>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11237837666381824
    m_Localized: 'Show craft menu

      <sprite name=tab>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11237961654202368
    m_Localized: 'Magnet same type of cards

      hold <sprite name=shift>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22862156355989504
    m_Localized: "Short on defenses? How shocking. I'll phone the Yoka\xEFs and beg
      for mercy on your behalf. Again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22863945553801216
    m_Localized: "Not ready? What a surprise! Calling the Yoka\xEFs to delay their
      attack because my 'defender' forgot to defend."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22864089716224000
    m_Localized: "Zero defenses? Brilliant strategy! Let me call the Yoka\xEFs and
      explain my defender needs a nap first."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
